1
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:07,150
Zankoku na tenshi no you ni

2
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:07,150
Just like the cruel angel

3
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:15,110
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

4
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:15,110
Young boy, become a legend

5
00:00:18,990 --> 00:00:22,790
2D4U PRESENTS:

6
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:26,000
Aoi kaze ga ima

7
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:26,000
Even though the untested breeze...

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,800
mune no doa o tataitemo

9
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,800
...taps at the door to your heart

10
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:37,470
Watashi dake o tada mitsumete hohoenderu anata

11
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:37,550
You just look solely at me and smile

12
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:44,730
Sotto fureru mono motomeru koto ni muchuu de

13
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:44,730
So intent on seeking out that gentle touch

14
00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:52,070
Unmei sae mada shiranai itaike na hitomi

15
00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:52,070
Such innocent eyes, still ignorant of their destiny

16
00:00:52,070 --> 00:00:55,950
Dakedo itsuka kizuku deshou

17
00:00:52,070 --> 00:00:55,950
But someday, you are sure to realize...

18
00:00:55,950 --> 00:00:58,870
sono senaka ni wa

19
00:00:55,950 --> 00:00:58,870
...that upon your back

20
00:00:59,530 --> 00:01:03,160
Haruka mirai mezasu tame

21
00:00:59,530 --> 00:01:03,160
You have the wings with which to fly...

22
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:06,830
no hane ga aru koto

23
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:06,960
...towards the distant future

24
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:10,960
Zankoku na tenshi no teeze

25
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,960
The cruel angel's thesis

26
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:14,630
Madobe kara yagate tobidatsu

27
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:14,630
Soon, you will take flight from the windowsill

28
00:01:14,630 --> 00:01:18,470
Hotobashiru atsui patosu de

29
00:01:14,630 --> 00:01:18,470
With your torrent of ardent pathos

30
00:01:18,470 --> 00:01:21,970
Omoide o uragiru nara

31
00:01:18,470 --> 00:01:21,970
If you are to betray our memories

32
00:01:21,970 --> 00:01:25,730
Kono sora o daite kagayaku

33
00:01:21,970 --> 00:01:25,730
You, who embrace these heavens and shine

34
00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:29,770
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

35
00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:29,770
Young boy, become a legend

36
00:01:30,830 --> 00:01:34,400
Mom! Mom! I've been chosen!

37
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:37,110
I'm an elite pilot, chosen to
protect all of mankind!

38
00:01:37,110 --> 00:01:39,110
I'm the best in the world!

39
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:41,580
It's supposed to be a secret!

40
00:01:41,580 --> 00:01:43,900
But I'll tell you anyway! Just for you!

41
00:01:44,350 --> 00:01:46,790
Everyone will be nice to us from now on!

42
00:01:46,790 --> 00:01:48,950
So, we won't be lonely anymore!

43
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:53,580
So, we'll be fine, even without Dad around!
We won't be lonely anymore!

44
00:01:54,020 --> 00:01:56,540
So, look! Look at me!

45
00:01:57,070 --> 00:01:58,790
<i>Come on, Mom!</i>

46
00:02:07,080 --> 00:02:09,180
Synch rate, zero...

47
00:02:09,180 --> 00:02:11,940
Not qualified to be the Second Child...

48
00:02:11,940 --> 00:02:14,620
There's no reason for me to exist anymore.

49
00:02:14,620 --> 00:02:17,240
Because no one will look at me now.

50
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:19,360
Not Dad, not Mom, not anyone.

51
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:22,400
There's no reason for me to live now.

52
00:02:29,790 --> 00:02:32,990
Asuka Langley Sohryu, correct?

53
00:02:34,190 --> 00:02:38,210
Intelligence Division 2 reports that they have
the Second Child safely in their custody.

54
00:02:38,210 --> 00:02:39,510
I see.

55
00:02:39,510 --> 00:02:43,390
It isn't like Division 2 to take seven days to
find her on top of losing her in the first place.

56
00:02:43,390 --> 00:02:45,260
It's probably on purpose.

57
00:02:45,260 --> 00:02:47,980
Maybe they're trying to spite us
here in the Tactical Division.

58
00:02:47,980 --> 00:02:49,470
Possibly.

59
00:02:49,790 --> 00:02:53,230
And today, Asuka's replacement,
the Fifth Child, arrives.

60
00:02:53,230 --> 00:02:55,230
Everything is just too perfect.

61
00:03:03,010 --> 00:03:04,650
Rei Ayanami...

62
00:03:05,050 --> 00:03:07,950
So, that feeling I got really was her.

63
00:03:07,950 --> 00:03:09,530
Like Mother...

64
00:03:09,890 --> 00:03:13,030
Rei Ayanami and Mother...

65
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:16,330
What are you doing, Father?

66
00:03:18,110 --> 00:03:19,670
Commander Ikari...

67
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:22,130
The cat died.

68
00:03:22,130 --> 00:03:24,970
The one I'd left in my grandmother's care.

69
00:03:24,970 --> 00:03:27,180
I hadn't paid any attention to her for so long,

70
00:03:27,180 --> 00:03:30,380
but now, suddenly, I'll never see her again.

71
00:03:31,330 --> 00:03:34,560
Why did you destroy the dummy system?

72
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:38,430
Not the dummy system,
what I destroyed was Rei.

73
00:03:39,340 --> 00:03:42,190
I will only ask you this once. Why?

74
00:03:42,190 --> 00:03:45,490
Because I am no longer happy,
even when you make love to me.

75
00:03:45,490 --> 00:03:47,790
Why don't you just have your way
with my body?!

76
00:03:47,790 --> 00:03:49,040
Like you did that time!

77
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:50,960
I'm disappointed in you.

78
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:52,290
Disappointed?!

79
00:03:52,290 --> 00:03:55,000
You never hoped or expected anything
from me to begin with!

80
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:58,450
Nothing from me! Not anything! Nothing!

81
00:04:02,150 --> 00:04:04,800
What am I supposed to do, Mother?

82
00:04:06,700 --> 00:04:09,760
I wonder where Asuka is?

83
00:04:10,530 --> 00:04:12,890
But what would be the point in seeing her?

84
00:04:12,890 --> 00:04:15,430
Talk to her about Ayanami or something?

85
00:04:23,780 --> 00:04:29,270
Everyone, including Toji and Kensuke,
lost their homes and left.

86
00:04:29,270 --> 00:04:31,320
My friends...

87
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:34,210
I don't have anyone I can
call a friend anymore.

88
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:36,160
There's no one.

89
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:38,840
I can't go see Ayanami.

90
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:40,800
I don't have the courage for it.

91
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:43,250
I don't know how I'm supposed to face her.

92
00:04:44,070 --> 00:04:47,670
Asuka, Miss Misato, Mother...

93
00:04:48,070 --> 00:04:49,970
What should I...

94
00:04:49,970 --> 00:04:51,920
What should I do?

95
00:05:12,050 --> 00:05:13,820
Singing is great.

96
00:05:14,260 --> 00:05:16,500
Singing enriches the soul.

97
00:05:16,500 --> 00:05:19,660
It's the crowning achievement of the
civilization that the Lilim created.

98
00:05:19,660 --> 00:05:21,700
Don't you feel the same?

99
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:24,250
Shinji Ikari?

100
00:05:24,250 --> 00:05:25,590
My name...

101
00:05:25,590 --> 00:05:27,430
Everyone knows your name.

102
00:05:27,430 --> 00:05:28,760
I don't mean to be rude,

103
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:31,560
but I think you should be a little more
aware of your position.

104
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:33,440
You think so?

105
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:35,100
Who are you?

106
00:05:35,100 --> 00:05:37,720
I'm Kaworu, Kaworu Nagisa.

107
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:39,900
One of the children that's part of
the design, just like you.

108
00:05:39,900 --> 00:05:41,440
I'm the Fifth Child.

109
00:05:41,440 --> 00:05:42,940
The Fifth Child?

110
00:05:42,940 --> 00:05:45,570
You are? Nagisa?

111
00:05:45,570 --> 00:05:47,990
You can just call me Kaworu, Ikari.

112
00:05:47,990 --> 00:05:50,830
You can call me Shinji too.

113
00:05:54,350 --> 00:05:57,290
It appears the Fifth Child has just arrived.

114
00:05:57,500 --> 00:06:00,710
Kaworu Nagisa, his past records
have already been erased.

115
00:06:00,710 --> 00:06:02,500
The same as Rei...

116
00:06:02,500 --> 00:06:06,380
But the one thing we do know is that his
birthday coincides with the Second Impact.

117
00:06:06,380 --> 00:06:08,840
The Committee sent him directly to us.

118
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:10,850
There's bound to be something to this.

119
00:06:10,850 --> 00:06:14,600
In the Marduk Report, the matter of the Fifth
Child is also designated as confidential.

120
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:18,440
So, I did a little hacking into the
Intelligence Department's database.

121
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:20,400
You're so reckless!

122
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:22,260
It was worth it though.

123
00:06:22,830 --> 00:06:25,350
I found out where Miss Ritsuko's being held.

124
00:06:25,790 --> 00:06:27,990
How do you want to go about the
Fifth Child's synch test?

125
00:06:27,990 --> 00:06:30,030
Let's hold off on the trick questions today

126
00:06:30,030 --> 00:06:33,050
and get a straight reading
on what he's capable of.

127
00:06:33,050 --> 00:06:35,160
Fixing graph depth.

128
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:37,000
Try lowering it another point three.

129
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,200
Yes, Sir.

130
00:06:39,430 --> 00:06:41,710
Are these data readouts accurate?

131
00:06:41,710 --> 00:06:44,630
All instrumentation is operating normally, Sir.

132
00:06:44,630 --> 00:06:47,670
The Magi have not detected
any errors in the data, Sir.

133
00:06:47,670 --> 00:06:49,680
Who would have expected that he would
synchronize with Unit 02

134
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:51,140
without the core being reconfigured?

135
00:06:51,340 --> 00:06:52,550
This boy...

136
00:06:52,550 --> 00:06:54,510
But this is beyond belief!

137
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:57,390
This should be impossible, given the system.

138
00:06:57,390 --> 00:06:59,190
Nevertheless, these are the facts.

139
00:06:59,190 --> 00:07:02,580
First, accept the facts for what they are,
and then investigate the why behind them.

140
00:07:02,580 --> 00:07:07,990
<i>Central Dogma is currently locked down.
Please use Route 22 as a detour.</i>

141
00:07:07,990 --> 00:07:10,650
You're the First Child, aren't you?

142
00:07:11,550 --> 00:07:13,160
Rei Ayanami...

143
00:07:14,340 --> 00:07:16,360
You're the same as me.

144
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:18,200
Who are you?

145
00:07:18,850 --> 00:07:22,000
It seems the Fifth Child has
made contact with Rei.

146
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,130
I see.

147
00:07:23,130 --> 00:07:24,630
The Magi are currently pouring
all their resources

148
00:07:24,630 --> 00:07:26,750
into analyzing the data we got
from the Fifth Child.

149
00:07:26,750 --> 00:07:29,970
And yet, we still have no idea what he is.

150
00:07:29,970 --> 00:07:32,050
Who in the world is that boy?

151
00:07:32,050 --> 00:07:33,550
Do not enter without permission.
I'll kill you if you come without asking!

152
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:42,350
Shinji still hasn't returned either.

153
00:07:42,510 --> 00:07:44,810
I've failed as a guardian.

154
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:49,610
<i>Central Dogma is currently open.</i>

155
00:07:49,610 --> 00:07:51,860
<i>Please use Route 3 to transfer.</i>

156
00:07:52,110 --> 00:07:54,570
Hi, were you waiting for me?

157
00:07:54,970 --> 00:07:58,040
No, not really. That's not what I was...

158
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:59,370
What are you doing today?

159
00:07:59,370 --> 00:08:02,160
Well, the regular tests are over,

160
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:04,740
so all I have left is to take a shower
and go home, but...

161
00:08:05,430 --> 00:08:09,090
But the truth is, lately, I don't
really want to go home.

162
00:08:09,090 --> 00:08:10,590
A place to return to...

163
00:08:10,590 --> 00:08:13,510
The fact that you have a home
will lead to your happiness.

164
00:08:13,510 --> 00:08:14,760
It's a very good thing.

165
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:15,970
You think so?

166
00:08:15,970 --> 00:08:18,390
I'd like to talk more with you.

167
00:08:18,390 --> 00:08:20,010
May I come with you?

168
00:08:20,700 --> 00:08:23,430
To take a shower. You still need
to go take one, right?

169
00:08:24,660 --> 00:08:25,860
Is that a no?

170
00:08:25,860 --> 00:08:28,720
Oh, no, that's not what I meant.

171
00:08:35,300 --> 00:08:38,860
You go to such extremes to avoid first contact.

172
00:08:39,260 --> 00:08:42,120
Are you afraid of connecting with other people?

173
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:44,620
If you don't get close to others,

174
00:08:44,620 --> 00:08:46,790
you'll never be betrayed and
you'll never hurt each other.

175
00:08:46,790 --> 00:08:50,250
But you'll also never be able
to forget your loneliness.

176
00:08:50,250 --> 00:08:53,380
Humans can never banish
their loneliness for good,

177
00:08:53,380 --> 00:08:55,320
because being human means being alone.

178
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:57,760
But humans are able to go on with their lives

179
00:08:57,760 --> 00:09:00,010
because they're able to forget it every so often.

180
00:09:07,160 --> 00:09:08,690
It's time.

181
00:09:08,690 --> 00:09:10,320
Is it over already?

182
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:12,490
Yeah, we better go to bed.

183
00:09:12,490 --> 00:09:13,820
Together?

184
00:09:13,820 --> 00:09:17,450
Oh, no! I think there's probably
a room ready for you.

185
00:09:17,450 --> 00:09:19,120
A separate one.

186
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:20,530
I see.

187
00:09:21,050 --> 00:09:24,610
Humans constantly feel pain in their hearts.

188
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:29,490
Because the heart is so sensitive to pain,
humans also feel that to live is to suffer.

189
00:09:30,310 --> 00:09:34,170
You're so delicate, like glass,
especially your heart.

190
00:09:34,170 --> 00:09:35,130
Me?

191
00:09:35,130 --> 00:09:37,500
Yes, you have my regard for it.

192
00:09:37,500 --> 00:09:39,010
Regard?

193
00:09:39,010 --> 00:09:40,300
It means, I love you.

194
00:09:40,300 --> 00:09:41,510
EPISODE 24

195
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:43,390
THE
FINAL
MESSENGER

196
00:09:47,540 --> 00:09:52,270
Nerv, the organization formed to be
Seele's executive branch...

197
00:09:52,270 --> 00:09:56,030
It was created in order to put
our script into practice.

198
00:09:56,030 --> 00:09:59,660
But now, it has become an organization
in the possession of one individual.

199
00:09:59,870 --> 00:10:02,700
Precisely, we must take it back.

200
00:10:02,870 --> 00:10:04,450
Before the promised day.

201
00:10:04,700 --> 00:10:08,330
Nerv and the Eva series must be
in their true forms.

202
00:10:08,500 --> 00:10:12,750
Ikari, you will bear the responsibility of
your malfeasance towards Seele.

203
00:10:13,230 --> 00:10:16,800
The time that has been given to us runs short.

204
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:21,510
But the Lance of Longinus that stood
in the way of our desire is no more.

205
00:10:21,990 --> 00:10:24,310
Soon, the final Angel will appear.

206
00:10:24,310 --> 00:10:26,520
If we destroy it, our wish will come true.

207
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:28,760
Just a little longer, Yui.

208
00:10:30,290 --> 00:10:32,680
Why am I here?

209
00:10:33,540 --> 00:10:36,480
Why am I alive again?

210
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:38,950
For what?

211
00:10:39,260 --> 00:10:41,400
And for whom?

212
00:10:41,400 --> 00:10:44,240
The Fifth Child... That boy...

213
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:46,680
I feel as if he's the same as me.

214
00:10:46,680 --> 00:10:48,410
Why?

215
00:10:54,020 --> 00:10:56,630
I'm glad we're on the outskirts of the city,

216
00:10:56,630 --> 00:10:59,080
because it kept you safe from all that.

217
00:10:59,300 --> 00:11:02,280
But there's no guarantee that will be
the case next time.

218
00:11:02,280 --> 00:11:06,060
So, the Horaki family will be taking care
of you starting tomorrow.

219
00:11:06,060 --> 00:11:08,560
This will be goodbye for a while, Pen Pen.

220
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:18,530
Come on, I'll sleep on the floor.

221
00:11:18,530 --> 00:11:19,530
It's okay.

222
00:11:19,530 --> 00:11:21,910
You're the one who's doing me a favor
by letting me stay over.

223
00:11:21,910 --> 00:11:23,570
I'm fine where I am.

224
00:11:26,800 --> 00:11:29,320
What do you want to talk about?

225
00:11:30,220 --> 00:11:33,030
There are things you want me to hear, right?

226
00:11:34,190 --> 00:11:37,250
All sons of things have happened
since I came here.

227
00:11:38,110 --> 00:11:41,620
Before coming here, I used
to live with my teacher.

228
00:11:41,620 --> 00:11:44,390
The days were peaceful.
Nothing ever happened.

229
00:11:44,390 --> 00:11:46,960
I only had to exist there.

230
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:51,980
But that was okay, because there
was nothing I had to do.

231
00:11:51,980 --> 00:11:54,270
Did you hate people?

232
00:11:54,270 --> 00:11:57,320
Not really, I think it didn't matter,
one way or another.

233
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:59,850
But I did hate my father.

234
00:12:01,130 --> 00:12:03,900
Why am I telling Kaworu all this?

235
00:12:07,090 --> 00:12:10,410
Maybe I was born, so that I would meet you.

236
00:12:11,680 --> 00:12:14,460
How did it go? Did you get any data on him?

237
00:12:14,630 --> 00:12:15,920
Here it is.

238
00:12:15,920 --> 00:12:18,250
I borrowed it from First Lieutenant
Ibuki without her permission.

239
00:12:18,250 --> 00:12:21,920
I'm sorry I keep making you do
these theft-like things.

240
00:12:22,400 --> 00:12:23,630
What is this?!

241
00:12:23,630 --> 00:12:25,970
It's no wonder Maya can't release
this information.

242
00:12:25,970 --> 00:12:27,640
It's all theoretically impossible data.

243
00:12:27,640 --> 00:12:31,100
You're right. It only deepens the mystery.

244
00:12:31,100 --> 00:12:34,600
To think that he can freely set
his synch rate with the Eva...

245
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:36,650
And of his own will at that.

246
00:12:36,650 --> 00:12:39,220
I guess this is yet again no time to be
worried about appearances.

247
00:12:40,250 --> 00:12:41,940
I'm surprised you made it in.

248
00:12:41,940 --> 00:12:43,900
There's something I want to ask you.

249
00:12:43,900 --> 00:12:46,070
All conversations in here
are recorded, you know.

250
00:12:46,070 --> 00:12:47,530
I don't care.

251
00:12:47,530 --> 00:12:50,690
Just who is that boy? The Fifth Child?

252
00:12:51,430 --> 00:12:53,710
He is likely the final messenger.

253
00:12:55,890 --> 00:12:57,040
Come on, let's go.

254
00:12:57,040 --> 00:13:00,540
Come with me, Adam's alter ego
and servant of the Lilim.

255
00:13:07,190 --> 00:13:08,720
Eva Unit 02 is activating!

256
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:10,890
That's impossible! Where's Asuka?

257
00:13:10,890 --> 00:13:13,810
In med room 303! It's been confirmed!

258
00:13:13,810 --> 00:13:15,100
Then who in the world is...

259
00:13:15,100 --> 00:13:18,690
It's unmanned! No entry plug
is present in Unit 02!

260
00:13:18,690 --> 00:13:21,980
There's no one? It's not the Fifth Child?

261
00:13:22,880 --> 00:13:25,700
A developing AT Field has been
detected in Central Dogma!

262
00:13:25,700 --> 00:13:26,490
Is that Unit 02?!

263
00:13:26,490 --> 00:13:27,910
No, its pattern is blue!

264
00:13:27,910 --> 00:13:29,240
There's no doubt about it! It's an Angel!

265
00:13:29,490 --> 00:13:30,780
What did you say?!

266
00:13:31,890 --> 00:13:33,830
An Angel? That boy?

267
00:13:36,060 --> 00:13:39,000
Target has passed through Level 4
and is still descending!

268
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:41,250
It's no good! We can't cut the power
to the linear carriage!

269
00:13:41,250 --> 00:13:43,010
Target has passed through Level 5!

270
00:13:43,010 --> 00:13:46,380
Emergency lockdown! Close all
partitions in Central Dogma!

271
00:13:46,380 --> 00:13:48,130
Buy us some time, no matter how little.

272
00:13:48,690 --> 00:13:51,310
Emergency lockdown, all Malebolge
levels being closed.

273
00:13:51,310 --> 00:13:53,720
All personnel, evacuate.
All personnel, evacuate.

274
00:13:54,160 --> 00:13:57,600
I never imagined Seele would
send one directly to us.

275
00:13:57,600 --> 00:14:01,600
The old men intend to step up
the schedule by forcing our hand.

276
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:06,610
The final Angel has entered Central Dogma
and is currently descending.

277
00:14:06,610 --> 00:14:07,820
It's all going according to plan.

278
00:14:07,820 --> 00:14:10,410
Ikari, you were a good friend,

279
00:14:10,410 --> 00:14:14,660
a comrade who shared our aspirations,
and a collaborator who understood.

280
00:14:14,660 --> 00:14:16,620
This is your final task.

281
00:14:16,620 --> 00:14:19,320
I will be praying that it will be
accomplished by Unit 01.

282
00:14:20,980 --> 00:14:24,090
Unit 02 is breaking through
the armored partitions!

283
00:14:24,090 --> 00:14:26,170
Target has passed through Cocytus 2!

284
00:14:26,420 --> 00:14:28,380
Send Eva Unit 01 after it.

285
00:14:28,380 --> 00:14:29,260
Yes, Sir.

286
00:14:29,260 --> 00:14:33,800
Stop it from invading Terminal Dogma
at all costs.

287
00:14:36,980 --> 00:14:39,650
But why did the Angel take Unit 02?

288
00:14:39,650 --> 00:14:42,360
Could it be planning to merge with Unit 02?

289
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:45,030
Or possibly to bring about destruction.

290
00:14:45,030 --> 00:14:46,530
It's a lie! A lie! A lie!

291
00:14:46,530 --> 00:14:49,530
That Kaworu is... He's an Angel?!

292
00:14:49,530 --> 00:14:51,240
That's a lie!

293
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:53,160
It's a fact. Accept it.

294
00:14:53,160 --> 00:14:55,690
Move out, understood?

295
00:14:59,180 --> 00:15:01,170
Shinji's so late.

296
00:15:01,170 --> 00:15:03,250
Eva Unit 01 heading down Route 2!

297
00:15:03,250 --> 00:15:04,950
In pursuit of target!

298
00:15:05,900 --> 00:15:08,760
You betrayed me! You betrayed my feelings!

299
00:15:08,760 --> 00:15:10,830
You betrayed me, just like Father did!

300
00:15:11,530 --> 00:15:14,300
Unit 01 has reached Level 4.
Coming into contact with the target!

301
00:15:14,300 --> 00:15:15,840
There he is!

302
00:15:16,660 --> 00:15:18,480
I've been waiting for you, Shinji.

303
00:15:18,680 --> 00:15:19,890
Kaworu!

304
00:15:24,370 --> 00:15:25,980
Asuka, sorry!

305
00:15:29,130 --> 00:15:30,700
The Eva series.

306
00:15:30,700 --> 00:15:34,030
Born from Adam, they are an abhorrent
existence for humans.

307
00:15:34,030 --> 00:15:37,040
And the Lilim will even use them
in order to survive.

308
00:15:37,040 --> 00:15:38,610
I can't understand.

309
00:15:41,100 --> 00:15:44,290
Kaworu, stop this! Why?!

310
00:15:44,290 --> 00:15:47,300
The Eva are made of the same body as I am.

311
00:15:47,300 --> 00:15:49,970
Because I am born from Adam as well.

312
00:15:49,970 --> 00:15:52,680
I could merge with them,
if only they didn't have souls.

313
00:15:52,680 --> 00:15:56,460
Unit 02's soul has shut itself away for now.

314
00:15:58,490 --> 00:15:59,730
An AT Field!

315
00:15:59,730 --> 00:16:03,060
That's right. That's what you Lilim call it.

316
00:16:03,060 --> 00:16:06,150
The sacred domain where none may trespass.

317
00:16:06,150 --> 00:16:07,940
The light of the soul.

318
00:16:07,940 --> 00:16:09,900
Lilim, you know, don't you?

319
00:16:09,900 --> 00:16:13,490
That the AT Field is the wall that
everyone has in their heart?

320
00:16:13,490 --> 00:16:15,820
I don't know anything about that, Kaworu!

321
00:16:18,470 --> 00:16:20,250
Both Eva units have reached the lowest level.

322
00:16:20,250 --> 00:16:22,660
Target distance to Terminal Dogma, 20.

323
00:16:23,930 --> 00:16:27,790
If Unit 01's signal disappears
and another change occurs...

324
00:16:27,790 --> 00:16:31,340
I know. We set this place to self-destruct, right?

325
00:16:31,340 --> 00:16:34,300
It'll be better than letting them
set off the Third Impact.

326
00:16:34,300 --> 00:16:35,760
I'm sorry.

327
00:16:35,760 --> 00:16:38,450
It's okay, as long as I'm with you.

328
00:16:38,450 --> 00:16:39,800
Thank you.

329
00:16:44,080 --> 00:16:46,200
The fate of man...

330
00:16:46,200 --> 00:16:49,270
The hope of man is written in sorrow.

331
00:16:51,990 --> 00:16:53,240
What's going on?!

332
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:55,780
It's an AT Field of unprecedented power!

333
00:16:55,780 --> 00:16:57,570
Light, electromagnetic, and particle waves!

334
00:16:57,570 --> 00:17:00,040
It's blocking them all! We can't
monitor anything in there!

335
00:17:00,040 --> 00:17:01,750
We're truly sealed off.

336
00:17:01,750 --> 00:17:04,960
We've lost the target along with
Eva Unit 01 and Unit 02!

337
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:07,160
We can't contact the pilot!

338
00:17:18,650 --> 00:17:19,920
Kaworu!

339
00:17:23,280 --> 00:17:24,970
Wait!

340
00:17:36,090 --> 00:17:38,030
The final safety has been released!

341
00:17:38,030 --> 00:17:40,530
Heaven's Door is opening!

342
00:17:41,180 --> 00:17:43,740
So, an Angel has finally reached it.

343
00:17:44,720 --> 00:17:46,200
Hyuga...

344
00:17:51,850 --> 00:17:52,800
What's that?!

345
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:53,670
What's the situation?

346
00:17:53,670 --> 00:17:55,050
It's an AT Field!

347
00:17:55,050 --> 00:17:56,970
The same kind of AT Field that we saw earlier

348
00:17:56,970 --> 00:17:59,600
has developed near the barrier
around Terminal Dogma!

349
00:17:59,600 --> 00:18:01,850
It's entering the barrier!

350
00:18:01,850 --> 00:18:03,810
It can't be! Another Angel?!

351
00:18:03,810 --> 00:18:05,350
It's no good! We can't confirm that!

352
00:18:05,350 --> 00:18:07,980
Oh, no, it disappeared!

353
00:18:07,980 --> 00:18:10,060
Disappeared?! The Angel did?!

354
00:18:11,870 --> 00:18:15,120
Adam, our mother.

355
00:18:15,120 --> 00:18:19,030
Must all who were born of Adam
return to Adam?

356
00:18:19,030 --> 00:18:21,270
Even at the cost of destroying humanity?

357
00:18:22,220 --> 00:18:24,270
No! This is...

358
00:18:24,270 --> 00:18:25,790
Lilith?

359
00:18:25,790 --> 00:18:28,450
I see, so that's what this is about, Lilim.

360
00:18:41,820 --> 00:18:43,850
Thank you, Shinji.

361
00:18:43,850 --> 00:18:46,800
I wanted you to stop Unit 02.

362
00:18:46,800 --> 00:18:50,060
Otherwise, I may have gone on living with her.

363
00:18:50,310 --> 00:18:52,480
Kaworu, why?

364
00:18:52,480 --> 00:18:54,360
Because it's my destiny to continue to live

365
00:18:54,360 --> 00:18:58,060
even if it may result in the
destruction of humanity.

366
00:18:58,880 --> 00:19:01,200
But I can also die here.

367
00:19:01,200 --> 00:19:04,080
Life and death are of equal value to me.

368
00:19:04,080 --> 00:19:07,660
Dying of your own will, that is the one
and only absolute freedom there is.

369
00:19:07,660 --> 00:19:09,240
What?

370
00:19:09,240 --> 00:19:12,790
Kaworu, I don't understand what you're saying!

371
00:19:12,790 --> 00:19:14,080
Kaworu...

372
00:19:14,080 --> 00:19:16,200
My last will and testament.

373
00:19:16,200 --> 00:19:18,330
Now, erase me from this world.

374
00:19:19,270 --> 00:19:22,370
If you don't, you will be
the ones who are erased.

375
00:19:22,370 --> 00:19:27,500
Only one life form will be chosen to survive
the time of destruction and be given a future.

376
00:19:27,500 --> 00:19:30,930
And you are not a being who should die.

377
00:19:36,250 --> 00:19:38,740
Your people need the future.

378
00:19:40,500 --> 00:19:44,240
Thank you. I'm glad I met you.

379
00:21:08,550 --> 00:21:14,750
Kaworu said that he loved me.

380
00:21:16,310 --> 00:21:18,380
It was...

381
00:21:18,380 --> 00:21:21,160
It was the first time someone
told me they loved me.

382
00:21:22,690 --> 00:21:26,290
He was like me, and like Ayanami.

383
00:21:28,070 --> 00:21:30,380
I loved him.

384
00:21:30,820 --> 00:21:34,090
Kaworu was the one who should have survived.

385
00:21:34,790 --> 00:21:38,300
He was a much better person than I am.

386
00:21:39,960 --> 00:21:42,820
Kaworu should have been the one to survive.

387
00:21:42,820 --> 00:21:43,570
You're wrong.

388
00:21:43,740 --> 00:21:47,060
Only those who have the will to live
get to survive.

389
00:21:47,840 --> 00:21:49,660
He wished to die.

390
00:21:49,660 --> 00:21:53,540
He abandoned his will to live,
clinging instead to a false hope.

391
00:21:53,540 --> 00:21:55,610
You did nothing wrong, Shinji.

392
00:21:57,100 --> 00:21:59,310
You're cold, Miss Misato.

